Features of Preference Shares
Fixed Rate of Dividend: Preference shareholders
get a fixed rate of dividend before paying dividend
to equity shareholders.
No Security: Companies do not offer any security
against preference shares. The preference share
capital is a part of the owner's fund capital.
Voting Rights: The preference shareholders do not
get voting rights under general conditions.
